> I just discovered that this only handles the case when starting the project normally (F5). When running current scene (F6), the path is not validated. Interestingly, the project will crash on startup when folder is invalid (not caused by this PR). Can be easily tested by putting a Windows reserved name as data directory, e.g. CON.

